g the Gorilla Amanto mother ship, he realizes that he doesn't speak their language. Confused, Kondou tries conversing with them, only to inadvertently gain their support. However, someone associated with the princess crashes the ongoing ceremony. Will the wedding continue, or has Kondou just been saved from becoming the next Gorilla Prince?\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Anachronism","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Samurai","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":64,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Gintama: THE SEMI-FINAL","english":null,"native":"銀魂 THE SEMI-FINAL","romaji":"Gintama: THE SEMI-FINAL","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"银魂 THE SEMI-FINAL"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"銀魂 THE SEMI FINAL"}]},"trailer":{"id":"GFWgimHRucc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GFWgimHRucc/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}